{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BnAzDQ0_fnfZAjG-aQjB_A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.792471+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BnAzDQ0_fnfZAjG-aQjB_A","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQathcPF9BgXkWdSyEhNBrP0ZlwSmLVR3C02QH3WcT6kmE3G3UutxtEBfHFIFJCyAkxcHH4s2G3fw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJQathcPF9BgXkWdSyEhNBrP2TTwLZoCRjYHpYeDwicAdwRdRHuCs4kwEsTxicVOCeicTmPfCHEvjaPQQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京理工大学化学与化工学院源于1953年创办的哈尔滨军事工程学院炮兵工程系火炸药科，1988年9月成立化工学院，2021年4月更名为化学与化工学院。学院依托鲜明的学科特色，将学术立院与文化育人有机融合起来，弘扬以国家最高科技奖获得者、“工信楷模”、江苏“时代楷模”王泽山院士为代表的“一辈子只做一件事”的精神，将一代代建设者身上充分体现出的浓厚的家国情怀、强烈的社会责任感以及重道义、勇担当的优秀品格，凝塑成特有的“国之所需、吾志所向” 的学院精神。</span></p><p><span> 学院的化学工程与技术学科在全国第五轮学科评估中位列A+，化学学科进入 ESI国际学科领域全球排名前1‰。学院拥有应用化学、材料学、军事化学与烟火技术3个国家重点学科，化学工程与技术工信部重点学科，化学工程与技术江苏高校优势学科，军事化学与烟火技术“十三五”首批国防特色学科。</span></p><p><span>学院汇聚了一支包括工程院院士、国家杰青、长江学者、万人计划领军人才等在内的高水平师资队伍，现有教职工284人，专任教师194人，其中正高86人，副高83人。</span></p><p><span>学院面向国防重大需求和军民融合卡脖子技术，重点发展军事化学工程、民用爆炸化学工程、绿色化学与工艺、军民两用材料化工等特色方向，开辟了发射装药学，发展完善了我国特种能源化工理论体系，形成了鲜明的军民融合发展特色。</span></p><p><span>近年来，学院呈现出跨越式发展态势，取得了以国家最高科学技术奖、 国家技术发明一等奖及在《Science》 和《Nature》上发表的论文等为代表的一系列标志性成果，引领我国特种 能源化工行业跻身世界先进行列。 学院拥有国家级平台8个，省部级 平台17个，承担了军委创新特区重大专项、国家重点研发等重大项目100多项，年均科研经费2.5亿元。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQathcPF9BgXkWdSyEhNBrPW478aZSeTy1Qc7nGMTiaN1clHxEkDmgBGTHbotupiciaLNlnUY7Uo8PHg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJQathcPF9BgXkWdSyEhNBrP2TTwLZoCRjYHpYeDwicAdwRdRHuCs4kwEsTxicVOCeicTmPfCHEvjaPQQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>150 人左右（视报名情况动态选择）</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月18-22日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业与本院招生专业相近，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力。学科竞赛、科研训练已取得优良成绩者优先；已获得与本院招生专业相近的学术成果者优先；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，由化学与化工学院进行资格审核，通过邮件方式通知入选人员。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人需在</span><strong><span><span>2025年7月23日8:00前</span></span></strong><span>将申请材料（包括申请表、个人陈述、本科阶段成绩、英语水平证明及其他证明材料等）扫描合并为一个 pdf，邮件主题命名格式为：“</span><strong><span><span>本科院校-本科专业-姓名-联系方式</span></span></strong><span>”发至</span><strong><span><span>联系邮箱 </span></span></strong><span>yz103@njust.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span> </span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>开放日时间暂定于7月24日，将组织政策宣讲、学科讲座等活动，详细活动日程安排以后续实际通知为准。</span></p><p><span> </span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：王老师、张老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-84315506</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz103@njust.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>报名人员加QQ群：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/iaACVbcpOKJQathcPF9BgXkWdSyEhNBrPl3Ont3wIKof1x075y4O7LBX3UqzeymtnXyRfG1bwVjD5bh7srD0xhw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQathcPF9BgXkWdSyEhNBrPw3GAYRQ8YcnpRBsdA2rxksOiczf01vagy9hPlwpCRXIsu6UdDy65zWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></sectio